      "narration": "Switch the construction mode: the same three blue arrows now chain tip-to-tail along the box edges and end exactly at the red arrowhead, proving A = A_x + A_y + A_z.",
      "state": { "vectorCase": "full xyz", "ax": 2, "ay": 3, "az": 2.5, "constructionMode": "Head-to-tail build" }
